gwv(){return"What services does Skypostal Logistics offer?"},
gtE(){return"At Skypostal Logistics, we offer a range of logistics services, including Express Shipping, Consulting Services, Storage Solutions, and more. Our services are designed to meet your individual and business needs, ensuring fast, secure, and efficient delivery."},
gv_(){return"How fast is Express Shipping?"},
gvA(){return"Our Express Shipping service delivers packages within 1-3 business days domestically and 3-5 business days internationally, depending on the destination."},
gtK(){return"Can I track my shipment?"},
gwA(){return"Yes, all shipments include real-time tracking. You can track your package using the tracking number provided at the time of shipment on our website or mobile app."},
gwr(){return"What areas do you serve?"},
gvZ(){return"Skypostal Logistics serves customers worldwide with a strong presence in North America, Europe, Asia, and Australia. Contact us for specific destination information."},
gws(){return"What are your storage service options?"},
gwn(){return"We offer short-term and long-term storage solutions with temperature-controlled facilities, secure warehousing, and inventory management services tailored to your needs."},
guZ(){return"How do I schedule a shipment?"},
gwE(){return"You can schedule a shipment through our website, mobile app, or by calling our customer service. We offer convenient pickup options or drop-off at our service centers."},
guk(){return"Do you provide logistics consulting for businesses?"},
gwB(){return"Yes, our team of logistics experts provides comprehensive consulting services to optimize your supply chain, reduce costs, and improve efficiency for businesses of all sizes."},
gwt(){return"What items are restricted from shipping?"},
gvV(){return"Restricted items include hazardous materials, illegal substances, perishable goods without proper packaging, and items prohibited by law. Please contact us for a complete list."},
guX(){return"How can I get a price quote?"},
gwC(){return"You can get an instant price quote using our online calculator on the website, or contact our customer service for customized quotes for complex shipping needs."},
guY(){return"How do I contact Skypostal Logistics?"},
gwD(){return"You can reach our customer service team via email at support@royalexpresslogistics.net, by phone at 1-800-ROYAL-XL, or through the contact form on our website."},
